        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Some of life's most meaningful moments happen around the table—the first cup of coffee in the morning, a bottle of wine opened for no reason, a dinner that lingers because no one wants the evening to end.</p><p>Atelier Quince began with a simple belief: the place where we gather deserves as much care as the people we gather with. We create objects that make everyday rituals feel more thoughtful, more beautiful, and more connected.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-200"
          }
        },
