        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For more than fifteen years, San Francisco was home to me. Somewhere in those years — in the fog rolling over the bay, the light falling across the hills, the quiet colors of the city — I fell in love with a certain kind of everyday beauty, and I never wanted to let it go. Atelier Quince began as a way to keep it. That love became our very first collection, <em>The Autumn City by the Bay</em> — the seasons, the light, and the shifting moods of San Francisco gathered into a palette of colors you could set on your own table. It was where everything started.</p><p>Since launching in Seoul in 2020, Atelier Quince has grown from Korea's leading department stores—including Hyundai, and Shinsegae—to homes and tables around the world. From those first shelves, our story has since crossed the ocean, growing from Seoul to the United States, and to tables far beyond where it began.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
