          }
        },
        "text_grn4jH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each collection holds a piece of San Francisco and a feeling I wanted to keep. Our signature <em>Rhapsody in Blue</em> was born one evening at the San Francisco Symphony; <em>The Fog City by the Bay</em> from the fog that wraps the city; <em>Life is All About Pattern</em> from the simple truth that our days weave into one pattern of living. Every piece is made by skilled artisans around the world, in thoughtful, limited runs — one cherished object meant to last, rather than a hundred that don't.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
