        "text_raUR3E": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Every Atelier Quince piece is shaped by the craft of skilled artisans around the world, each object carrying a little of the place and the hands it came from. We make in thoughtful, limited runs rather than mass quantities, so nothing loses the sense of care behind it. I would rather make one cherished piece that stays in your home for years than a hundred that don't.</p>",
